{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":36,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-1-02\",\"禮物\",\"禮物\",\"礼物\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要去買禮物。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào qù mǎi lǐwù.","english":"I am going to buy gifts.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-02","sourceFront":"禮物","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"明天是媽媽的生日，你想送她什麼禮物？","pinyin":"Míngtiān shì māma de shēngrì, nǐ xiǎng sòng tā shénme lǐwù?","english":"Tomorrow is mom’s birthday, what do you want to give her as a gift?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-04","sourceFront":"送","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"明天是友美的生日，我想送她一個禮物。","pinyin":"Míngtiān shì Yǒuměi de shēngrì, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge lǐwù.","english":"It is Youmei’s birthday tomorrow; I would like to give her a gift.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"謝謝，這是我去年的生日禮物。","pinyin":"Xièxie, zhè shì wǒ qùnián de shēngrì lǐwù.","english":"Thanks, this is my birthday gift from last year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A ceremonial thing 禮(ceremony) + 物(thing) given to someone is a gift."},{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-21\",\"旁边\",\"旁邊\",\"旁边\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"沙發上面、下面跟旁邊都沒有。媽，妳幫我找，好嗎？","pinyin":"Shāfā shàngmiàn, xiàmiàn gēn pángbiān dōu méiyǒu. Mā, nǐ bāng wǒ zhǎo, hǎo ma?","english":"It is neither on the sofa, under the sofa, nor beside the sofa. Mom, could you find it for me?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們學校旁邊有一家電影院。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xuéxiào pángbiān yǒu yì jiā diànyǐngyuàn.","english":"There is a movie theater next to our school.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-03","sourceFront":"電影院","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-12\",\"也许\",\"也許\",\"也许\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們去問老師，也許他可以幫你。","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù wèn lǎoshī, yěxǔ tā kěyǐ bāng nǐ.","english":"Let’s ask the teacher; maybe he can help you.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-12\",\"让\",\"讓\",\"让\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟還沒十八歲，爸爸不讓他喝酒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-12","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天是妹妹的生日，讓我們一起去 KTV 慶祝吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-12","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"聽到那首歌，讓李小姐哭得很傷心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-19","sourceFront":"哭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他常常遲到，讓老闆很生氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-17","sourceFront":"生氣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"結婚的時候，先生送了她一棟房子，讓她開心極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-16","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"黃小姐生日那天，男朋友送給她九百九十九朵玫瑰花，讓她感動得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-19","sourceFront":"感動","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幫助別人讓我覺得很快樂！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-08","sourceFront":"幫助","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽說可樂太甜了，不讓我喝第二瓶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-11","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},