B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了家人的健康，媽媽每天都早起準備營養豐富的早餐，讓我們一天的開始就很有精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-18","sourceFront":"營養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理這次願意採用新員工的建議，讓我們都嚇了一跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-18","sourceFront":"採用","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我舅舅在公司的表現樣樣都好，所以老闆打算明年讓他當經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-30","sourceFront":"樣樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"多閱讀書報、雜誌，能讓我們的知識更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-08","sourceFront":"閱讀","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孝順父母的方法很多，最簡單的就是不讓他們擔心、生氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-23","sourceFront":"孝順","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天晚上的風雨聲好可怕，讓我整個晚上都沒睡好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-42","sourceFront":"風雨聲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"九二一大地震時，臺灣人發揮了互相幫助的精神，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-33","sourceFront":"發揮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生的工作是讓病人恢復健康，甚至把寶貴的生命救回來，所以我們應該尊敬醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-37","sourceFront":"生命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大地震過後才幾天，這個災區的民眾除了收到許多衣服和食物，還收到五千萬元，讓大家又驚訝又感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-15","sourceFront":"驚訝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家動物餐廳的空間很大，可以讓客人的小動物自由自在地活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-43","sourceFront":"自由自在","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小白喝了太多酒，已經醉了，不能讓他繼續喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-11","sourceFront":"醉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些父母不讓孩子去夜店，主要是因為聽說那裡有人吸毒，也買得到毒品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-14","sourceFront":"毒品","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察的工作主要是保護民眾，讓好人不被傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-17","sourceFront":"傷害","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家超市賣的商品都是安全的，讓顧客買得安心、吃得安心，用的也安心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-02","sourceFront":"安心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母除了教導孩子做人做事的道理，也應該肯定他們的表現，讓他們更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-08","sourceFront":"教導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語中心除了有培養學生中文能力的課程，還安排了文化課，讓課程更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-32","sourceFront":"培養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sou