urceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的作業是寫一篇作文，可是我的腦子空空的，一個字也寫不出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-12","sourceFront":"空","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟：爺爺怎麼常把我和你的名字搞錯？ 哥哥：爺爺年紀太大了，腦子不清楚，好像不認得我們了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-29","sourceFront":"認得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-41\",\"忍耐\",\"忍耐\",\"忍耐\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我室友的生活習慣很差，我已經忍耐他很久了，真希望他馬上搬走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-41","sourceFront":"忍耐","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:怎麼回事？外面怎麼這麼吵？ B:鄰居在修理屋頂，快修理好了，你忍耐一下吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-39","sourceFront":"怎麼一回事","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事忍耐一下就過去了，什麼都想以吵架的方式解決，遲早會出事的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-14","sourceFront":"出事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想小便的時候千萬別忍耐，否則對健康的影響相當大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-50","sourceFront":"小便","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Steeling your heart to 忍(endure) hardship and 耐(resist) pain: 忍耐 means tolerate."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-18\",\"緊\",\"緊\",\"紧\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 臤(stern) hand takes the 糸(silk) taut → everything goes 緊(tense)."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-11\",\"对\",\"對\",\"对\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"對啊！聽說我們學校感冒、發燒的學生很多。","pinyin":"Duì a! Tīngshuō wǒmen xuéxiào gǎnmào, fāshāo de xuéshēng hěn duō.","english":"Right! I heard that many students from my school have a cold and fever.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對，我應該多注意身體健康。","pinyin":"Duì, wǒ yīnggāi duō zhùyì shēntǐ jiànkāng.","english":"You are right. I should pay more attention to it.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"期中考快要到了，老師說我們可以去圖書館對面的大教室看書。","pinyin":"Qízhōngkǎo kuàiyào dào le, lǎoshī shuō wǒmen kěyǐ qù túshūguǎn duìmiàn de dà jiàoshì kànshū.","english":"The midterm exam is coming soon. The teacher said we could use the big classroom across from the library for studying.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"沒關係，我們可以下個週末再來看。對了，妳要買鞋子吧？","pinyin":"Méiguānxi, wǒmen kěyǐ xià ge zhōumò zài lái kàn. Duìle, nǐ yào mǎi xiézi ba?","english":"It’s okay; we can come again next weekend. By the way, you want to buy shoes, don’t you?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-16\",\"當面\",\"當面\",\"当面\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"林阿姨來我家推銷保險，我不好意思當面拒絕她，只好假裝有急事要出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-16","sourceFront":"當面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學生與校長當面對話，希望學校改善教學設備和校園餐廳的服務品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小王的閱讀報告寫得很精彩，連教授都在課堂上當面誇獎他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-44","sourceFront":"誇獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 當(appropriate) and 面(face): 當面 means in person."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-34\",\"口\",\"口\",\"口\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"最近很多人感冒，你們要戴口罩，也要常常洗手。","pinyin":"Zuìjìn hěn duō rén gǎnmào, nǐmen yào dài kǒuzhào, yě yào chángcháng xǐshǒu.","english":"Many people got sick lately. You need to wear a surgical mask and wash your hands often.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 冂(frame) rests around 一(one) open space → the speaking 口(mouth)."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-2-17\",\"誠意\",\"誠意\",\"诚意\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他跟我道歉時一點兒誠意都沒有，所以我不會原諒他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-17","sourceFront":"誠意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-11\",\"高度\",\"高度\",\"高度\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這座橋對車子的高度有限制，開大車的人要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-11","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"使用高度技術製造出來的工業生產機器，操作起來往往更有效率。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-25","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-20\",\"省得\",\"省得\",\"省得\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"不管做任何事都應先了解情況，省得白花精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-20","sourceFront":"省得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-20\",\"分类\",\"分類\",\"分类\",\"N/V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"會議資料的分類不必太仔細，分得簡單清楚就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-20","sourceFront":"分類","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-05\",\"化學\",\"化學\",\"化学\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他以前化學成績常不及格，沒想到現在卻是有名的化學教授。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-05","sourceFront":"化學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這項化學實驗在過程中出了問題，我分析了很久才找出原因。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-38","sourceFront":"實驗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-60\",\"千万\",\"千萬\",\"千万\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"開車時萬一發生車禍，千萬要冷靜，以免情況更嚴重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-60","sourceFront":"千萬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"大地震過後才幾天，這個災區的民眾除了收到許多衣服和食物，還收到五千萬元，讓大家又驚訝又感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-15","sourceFront":"驚訝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"談生意時千萬別打斷客戶的話，不然做生意的機會很可能就斷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-46","sourceFront":"斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想小便的時候千萬別忍耐，否則對健康的影響相當大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-50","sourceFront":"小便","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時千萬別把頭探出車窗外，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-02","sourceFront":"探","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"千萬別帶著笨重的行李去旅行，那會給你帶來很多麻煩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-26","sourceFront":"笨重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-13\",\"脸色\",\"臉色\",\"脸色\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的臉色白不是因為不舒服，是因為他平日很少出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-13","sourceFront":"臉色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"她最近臉色都不好，我們是否該關心她一下？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-01","sourceFront":"是否","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-48\",\"體溫\",\"體溫\",\"体温\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"動物的體溫不見得都是不變的，像蛇的體溫就隨著環境而變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-48","sourceFront":"體溫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-37\",\"劳力\",\"勞力\",\"劳力\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-39\",\"联合国\",\"聯合國\",\"联合国\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在全球環境會議中，聯合國邀請了一些環保團體共同參與。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-39","sourceFront":"聯合國","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"了不起\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Feats so remarkable that you 了(clear) goals that others can 不(not) even 起(rise) to match: 了不起 means amazing, terrific."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"多麼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 多(many) and 麼(particle): 多麼 means how much."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"姐\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 女(woman) holds 且(both) hands of a younger child → 姐(elder sister)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"提\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 扌(hand) lifts up what is 是(right) and proper, carrying it high into view: 提(carry)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"明天見\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"明(bright) + 天(day) + 見(see): see you on the bright day → tomorrow."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"某\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Sampling the 甘(sweet) sap of a tall 木(tree) in the forest: a treat for 某(some) lucky traveler."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"水準\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 水(water) and 準(standard): 水準 means standard, level."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"隨時隨地\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Ready to 隨(follow) at any 時(time) and anywhere on the 地(earth): 隨時隨地 means anytime, anywhere."}]}
